{"reference":"1 Samuel 30","book":"1 Samuel","chapter":30,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Within First Samuel","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"First Samuel traces a movement from Eli’s failing priestly house through Samuel’s prophetic leadership and Saul’s rejected kingship to David’s anointing, rise, exile, and Saul’s death. This chapter appears within the portion of the book that follows David during his rise and exile.","provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_samuel_030_303079e2b546a60983c5700b"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}